  <name>Perch</name>
  <summary>A GTK client for X</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Perch is a native GTK 4 / libadwaita client for X. It talks to X through rettiwt-api using your own session, so you can read and post without a browser tab.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Following and For You timelines, with likes, reposts, quotes, bookmarks, replies and posting with images</li>
      <li>In-app viewer for photos, videos and GIFs</li>
      <li>Notifications and direct messages, with desktop notifications</li>
      <li>Listen to live Spaces and replays</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
